{"id":533,"title":"测验: 分而治之","summary":"这个简短的测验将测试你在前几课中所学到的关于分而治之的知识。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Quiz","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"897604ee-ebb4-47b8-86b1-97fe30987c0d","title":"","title_html":"","render_mode":"continuous","questions":[{"question_id":237,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"关于**分而治之**的算法，以下哪一项是**正确**的？","question_text_html":"<p>关于<strong>分而治之</strong>的算法，以下哪一项是<strong>正确</strong>的？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"问题被递归划分","text_html":"<p>问题被递归划分</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"合并较小的问题是分而治之的步骤之一","text_html":"<p>合并较小的问题是分而治之的步骤之一</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"子问题是原子性的","text_html":"<p>子问题是原子性的</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"以上都是","text_html":"<p>以上都是</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"问题被递归地划分为更小的子问题，这些子问题是原子性的。在解决每个原子问题后，合并处理，因为算法在递归树中向上回溯。","md_html":"<p>问题被递归地划分为更小的子问题，这些子问题是原子性的。在解决每个原子问题后，合并处理，因为算法在递归树中向上回溯。</p>\n"},"correct":true}]},{"question_id":238,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"二分搜索只适用于长度为偶数的列表，如`[1，2，3，4]`？","question_text_html":"<p>二分搜索只适用于长度为偶数的列表，如<code>[1，2，3，4]</code>？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"正确","text_html":"<p>正确</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"错误","text_html":"<p>错误</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"二分搜索对偶数和奇数长度的列表都有效。对于偶数和奇数长度的列表，都可以找到中间元素。","md_html":"<p>二分搜索对偶数和奇数长度的列表都有效。对于偶数和奇数长度的列表，都可以找到中间元素。</p>\n"},"correct":true}]},{"question_id":239,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"\n在 \"分而治之\" 的哪个步骤中，会有一个递归调用？","question_text_html":"<p>在 “分而治之” 的哪个步骤中，会有一个递归调用？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"合并","text_html":"<p>合并</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"分割","text_html":"<p>分割</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"问题被递归划分为一个个原子子问题，然后在从递归调用返回时被处理并合并。","md_html":"<p>问题被递归划分为一个个原子子问题，然后在从递归调用返回时被处理并合并。</p>\n"},"correct":true},{"text":"处理子问题","text_html":"<p>处理子问题</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"A和B都是","text_html":"<p>A和B都是</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false}]},{"question_id":240,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"以下哪种算法在本质上不是**分而治之**的算法？","question_text_html":"<p>以下哪种算法在本质上不是<strong>分而治之</strong>的算法？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"合并排序","text_html":"<p>合并排序</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"快速排序","text_html":"<p>快速排序</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"堆排序","text_html":"<p>堆排序</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true},{"text":"\n欧几里得算法","text_html":"<p>欧几里得算法</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false}]},{"question_id":241,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"一个高效算法在列表中找到**峰值元素**的最坏情况下的时间复杂度将是:","question_text_html":"<p>一个高效算法在列表中找到<strong>峰值元素</strong>的最坏情况下的时间复杂度将是:</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"$O(n)$","text_html":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"$O(log(n))$","text_html":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(log(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true},{"text":"$O(n*log(n))$","text_html":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n*log(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"$O(n*n)$","text_html":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annot